{"_id":"68a7360e8ec3d8323af130ad","nodeId":"s0Pi6CemUUsmZSEu2j2gH","roadmapSlug":"computer-science","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:54.940Z","description":"# B-Trees\n\nFun fact: it's a mystery, but the B could stand for Boeing, Balanced, or Bayer (co-inventor).\n\nIn Practice: B-Trees are widely used in databases. Most modern filesystems use B-trees (or Variants). In addition to its use in databases, the B-tree is also used in filesystems to allow quick random access to an arbitrary block in a particular file. The basic problem is turning the file block i address into a disk block (or perhaps to a cylinder-head-sector) address","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"B-Tree - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B-tree","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cbf"},{"type":"article","title":"B-Tree Datastructure","url":"http://btechsmartclass.com/data_structures/b-trees.html","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cc0"},{"type":"video","title":"Introduction to B-Trees","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I22wEC1tTGo&list=PLA5Lqm4uh9Bbq-E0ZnqTIa8LRaL77ica6&index=6","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cc1"},{"type":"video","title":"B-Tree Definition and Insertion","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s3bCdZGrgpA&index=7&list=PLA5Lqm4uh9Bbq-E0ZnqTIa8LRaL77ica6","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cc2"},{"type":"video","title":"B-Tree Deletion","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=svfnVhJOfMc&index=8&list=PLA5Lqm4uh9Bbq-E0ZnqTIa8LRaL77ica6","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cc3"},{"type":"video","title":"B-Trees (playlist) in 26 minutes","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL9xmBV_5YoZNFPPv98DjTdD9X6UI9KMHz","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3cc4"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:21.077Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/computer-science/content/s0Pi6CemUUsmZSEu2j2gH.md"}